<view class="page undercover">
  <view wx:if="{{sharePreview}}" class="card"><view class="title">无间风云</view><view>4～8 人面对面推理。通过微信打开完整小程序，连接房主的 Wi-Fi 或热点，就可以加入邀请的房间。</view></view>
  <view wx:elif="{{loading}}" class="card empty">正在准备调查桌…</view>
  <block wx:else>
    <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="notice error">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{networkMessage}}" class="notice">{{networkMessage}}</view>
    <view wx:if="{{inviteConflict}}" class="card"><view class="subtitle">加入「{{inviteName}}」</view><view class="muted">先退出当前房间，再加入好友邀请。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="switchInvitedRoom" disabled="{{submitting}}">退出当前房间并加入</button><button class="quiet" bindtap="dismissInvitation">暂不加入</button></view>
    <view wx:if="{{otherRoom}}" class="card"><view class="subtitle">另一桌还在等你</view><button class="primary" bindtap="continueOther">继续当前房间</button><button class="quiet" bindtap="leave">退出当前房间</button></view>
    <block wx:elif="{{screen === 'entry'}}">
      <view class="case-cover"><view class="eyebrow">GOOD COP BAD COP</view><view class="case-number">CASE / 004</view><view class="title">无间风云</view><view class="cover-copy"><view>每个人都戴着警徽。</view><view>但你，能相信谁？</view></view><view class="cover-badge">✦</view><view class="cover-meta">4～8 位真人 · 基础版 · 面对面推理</view></view>
      <view class="tabs"><view class="tab {{tab === 'create' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-tab="create" bindtap="switchTab">创建房间</view><view class="tab {{tab === 'join' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-tab="join" bindtap="switchTab">加入房间</view></view>
      <view class="card">
        <view wx:if="{{hasInvitation}}" class="invite-copy"><view class="subtitle">加入「{{inviteName}}」</view><view class="muted">无需口令。请连接房主的 Wi-Fi 或热点，房主 IP：{{ip}}</view></view>
        <text class="label">你的昵称</text><input class="input" data-key="nickname" value="{{nickname}}" bindinput="input" maxlength="16" placeholder="大家怎么称呼你？"/>
        <block wx:if="{{tab === 'create'}}"><text class="label">房间名称</text><input class="input" data-key="roomName" value="{{roomName}}" bindinput="input" maxlength="24"/></block>
        <block wx:elif="{{!hasInvitation}}"><view class="row"><text class="label">附近的无间风云房间</text><text class="link" bindtap="refresh">刷新 ↻</text></view><view wx:if="{{searchError}}" class="muted">{{searchError}}</view><view wx:if="{{!rooms.length}}" class="empty muted">寻找附近的调查桌…请连接同一 Wi-Fi</view><view wx:for="{{rooms}}" wx:key="id" class="room-option {{selectedRoom === item.id ? 'chosen' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="chooseRoom"><view>{{item.name}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.ip}} · {{item.count}}/8 人 · {{item.playing ? '进行中，仅原玩家重连' : '等待入座'}}</view></view><view class="link manual-link" bindtap="toggleManual">{{manual ? '收起手动输入' : '手动输入房主 IP →'}}</view><input wx:if="{{manual}}" class="input" data-key="ip" value="{{ip}}" bindinput="input" maxlength="15" placeholder="例如 192.168.1.8"/></block>
        <block wx:if="{{!hasInvitation}}"><text class="label">房间口令</text><input class="input" data-key="password" value="{{password}}" bindinput="input" password maxlength="16" placeholder="4～16 个字符，告诉同桌朋友"/></block>
        <button class="primary" bindtap="enter" loading="{{submitting}}" disabled="{{submitting || !nickname || (!hasInvitation && !password) || (tab === 'join' && !ip)}}">{{tab === 'create' ? '创建调查桌' : '加入调查桌'}}</button>
      </view><view class="muted lan-tip">需要 4～8 位真人，边讨论边推理。首次加载需要网络，之后牌局在局域网中运行。房主保持前台，离线设备重连后继续。</view>
    </block>
    <block wx:elif="{{!view}}"><view class="card empty">正在恢复房间连接…</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="restore">重新连接</button><button class="quiet" bindtap="leave">退出房间</button></block>
    <block wx:else>
      <view class="row table-heading"><view class="grow"><view class="room-title">{{view.room}}</view><view class="muted">无间风云 · 第 {{view.round || 1}} 局 · {{host ? '你是房主' : '局域网'}}</view></view><text class="connection {{connected ? 'online' : ''}}">{{connected ? '● 在线' : '○ 重连中'}}</text></view>
      <view wx:if="{{!connected}}" class="notice">请让房主回到前台。<text class="link" bindtap="restore">重新连接 →</text></view>
      <block wx:if="{{view.phase === 'lobby'}}">
        <view class="card"><view class="subtitle">警徽之下，各有秘密</view><view class="muted">每人三张身份、一张装备。找到队友，调查敌方领袖，配合开枪。</view></view>
        <view class="seat-grid lobby-grid"><view wx:for="{{players}}" wx:key="id" class="seat lobby-seat"><view class="row"><view class="seat-avatar">{{item.seat+1}}</view><text class="small muted">{{item.host ? '房主' : '玩家'}}</text></view><view class="seat-name">{{item.name}}{{item.me ? ' · 你' : ''}}</view><view class="small {{item.ready ? 'ready-text' : 'muted'}}">{{!item.online ? '已离线' : item.ready ? '已准备' : '等待准备'}}</view><text wx:if="{{host && !item.host}}" class="link small" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="kick">移出</text></view></view>
        <view class="card"><button class="{{my.ready ? 'secondary' : 'primary'}}" bindtap="ready" disabled="{{!canAct}}">{{my.ready ? '取消准备' : '我准备好了'}}</button><button wx:if="{{host}}" class="primary spaced" disabled="{{!canAct || !allReady}}" bindtap="start">开始游戏 · {{players.length}}/8 人</button><view class="small muted spaced">至少 4 人；所有人在线并准备后开局。</view></view>
        <view wx:if="{{host}}" class="card"><button class="secondary" open-type="share" disabled="{{!canShareRoom}}">分享房间，邀请好友</button><view class="small muted spaced">邀请包含房间信息，好友打开后直接加入大厅。</view><view class="row spaced"><text class="small muted">房主 IP：{{localIP || '连接 Wi-Fi 后刷新'}}</text><text class="link" bindtap="tapIP">{{localIP ? '复制' : '刷新'}}</text></view></view>
      </block>
      <block wx:else>
        <view class="phase-banner"><view class="row"><text class="phase-title">{{phaseTitle}}</text><text class="direction">{{view.direction === 1 ? '顺时针 ↻' : '逆时针 ↺'}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{view.phase !== 'over'}}" class="phase-copy">{{turnName}} 的回合{{isTurn ? ' · 轮到你' : ''}}</view><view wx:else class="phase-copy">{{view.reason}}</view></view>
        <view class="seat-grid"><view wx:for="{{players}}" wx:key="id" class="seat {{item.current ? 'current-seat' : ''}} {{item.dead ? 'eliminated' : ''}}"><view class="row seat-header"><view class="seat-avatar">{{item.seat+1}}</view><view class="grow"><view class="seat-name">{{item.name}}{{item.me ? ' · 你' : ''}}</view><view class="small muted">{{item.dead ? '已出局' : !item.online ? '离线' : view.phase === 'reveal' ? (item.seen ? '身份已确认' : '确认身份中') : item.current ? '当前回合' : '在场'}}</view></view></view><view class="identity-row"><view wx:for="{{item.cards}}" wx:for-item="identity" wx:key="slot" class="identity {{identity.open || view.phase === 'over' ? identity.role : 'face-down'}}"><text class="identity-number">{{identity.slot+1}}</text><text>{{identity.open || view.phase === 'over' ? identity.label : '✦'}}</text><text wx:if="{{identity.wounded}}" class="wound">受伤</text></view></view><view class="gun-line {{item.gun ? 'armed' : ''}}">{{item.gun ? '枪口 → '+item.gunName : '未持枪'}}<text class="equipment-count"> · 装备 {{item.equipmentCount}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{item.active.length}}" class="active-equipment"><text wx:for="{{item.active}}" wx:for-item="effect" wx:key="key">{{effect.name}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{item.sideName}}" class="small side-label">{{item.sideName}}</view></view></view>
        <view class="card private-panel"><view class="row"><view class="subtitle">你的私密档案</view><text class="link" bindtap="togglePrivate">{{privateOpen ? '遮住档案' : '查看档案'}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{!privateOpen}}" class="privacy-cover" bindtap="togglePrivate"><text>✦</text><view>身份 · 装备 · 调查笔记</view><view class="small muted">点击查看，注意遮挡屏幕</view></view><block wx:else><view class="side-pill {{view.side}}">{{sideName}}</view><view class="identity-row own-identities"><view wx:for="{{own}}" wx:key="slot" class="identity {{item.role}}"><text class="identity-number">{{item.slot+1}}</text><text>{{item.label}}</text><text class="small">{{item.open ? '已公开' : '仅你可见'}}</text><text wx:if="{{item.wounded}}" class="wound">受伤</text></view></view><view wx:for="{{hand}}" wx:key="index" class="equipment-card"><view class="equipment-title">{{item.name}}</view><view>{{item.text}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{!hand.length}}" class="small muted">当前没有手持装备。</view><view wx:if="{{known.length}}" class="notes"><view class="small muted">调查笔记 · 交换后的身份需重新确认</view><view wx:for="{{known}}" wx:key="index">{{item.name}} · 第 {{item.slot+1}} 张：<text class="note-role">{{item.label}}</text></view></view></block></view>
        <view wx:if="{{view.phase === 'reveal'}}" class="card"><view class="subtitle">先确认自己的身份</view><view class="muted">查看上方私密档案。探长属于正义，主谋属于腐败；普通警察按三张身份多数决定阵营。</view><button class="primary spaced" bindtap="seen" disabled="{{!canAct || view.seen || !privateOpen}}">{{view.seen ? '已确认，等待大家' : '我记住身份了'}}</button></view>
        <view wx:if="{{view.phase === 'turn' && isTurn}}" class="card command-panel"><view class="subtitle">选择本回合行动</view><view class="action-grid"><button class="{{selectedAction === 'investigate' ? 'primary' : 'secondary'}}" data-action="investigate" bindtap="selectAction" disabled="{{!canAct}}">调查</button><button class="{{selectedAction === 'arm' ? 'primary' : 'secondary'}}" data-action="arm" bindtap="selectAction" disabled="{{!canAct || !canArm}}">拿枪</button><button class="{{selectedAction === 'equip' ? 'primary' : 'secondary'}}" data-action="equip" bindtap="selectAction" disabled="{{!canAct}}">拿装备</button><button class="{{selectedAction === 'shoot' ? 'danger-button' : 'secondary'}}" data-action="shoot" bindtap="selectAction" disabled="{{!canAct || !canShoot}}">射击</button></view><block wx:if="{{selectedAction}}"><view wx:if="{{actionTargets.length}}"><text class="label">{{selectedAction === 'arm' ? '立即瞄准谁' : '调查谁'}}</text><view class="chips"><view wx:for="{{actionTargets}}" wx:key="id" class="choice-chip {{selectedTarget === item.id ? 'chosen' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="selectTarget">{{item.name}}</view></view></view><view wx:if="{{selectedAction === 'investigate' && selectedTarget}}"><text class="label">选择一张隐藏身份</text><view class="chips"><view wx:for="{{actionSlots}}" wx:key="slot" class="choice-chip {{selectedSlot === item.slot ? 'chosen' : ''}}" data-slot="{{item.slot}}" bindtap="selectSlot">第 {{item.slot+1}} 张</view></view></view><view wx:if="{{(selectedAction === 'arm' || selectedAction === 'equip') && hiddenOwn.length}}"><text class="label">需要公开自己的一张隐藏身份</text><view class="small muted">可先查看私密档案，再选择对应位置。</view><view class="chips"><view wx:for="{{hiddenOwn}}" wx:key="slot" class="choice-chip {{revealSlot === item.slot ? 'chosen' : ''}}" data-slot="{{item.slot}}" bindtap="revealSlot">第 {{item.slot+1}} 张</view></view></view><view wx:if="{{selectedAction === 'shoot'}}" class="notice">即将射击 {{myGunName}}；全桌可先响应装备。</view><button class="primary spaced" bindtap="declare" disabled="{{!actionValid}}">宣布行动，等待装备响应</button></block></view>
        <view wx:if="{{view.phase === 'response'}}" class="card response-panel"><view class="subtitle">{{pendingTitle}}{{pendingName ? ' → '+pendingName : ''}}</view><view class="muted">存活玩家都确认后结算。有人使用装备后，大家重新确认。</view><view class="response-wait small">待确认：{{responseNames}}</view><button class="primary" bindtap="pass" disabled="{{!canAct || passed || my.dead}}">{{my.dead ? '你已出局，旁观结算' : passed ? '已确认，等待其他玩家' : '不使用装备，确认继续'}}</button></view>
        <view wx:if="{{view.phase === 'aim'}}" class="card"><view class="subtitle">调整枪口，结束回合</view><view class="small muted">可保持目标，也可以改瞄另一名存活玩家。</view><view wx:if="{{isTurn}}" class="chips"><button wx:for="{{aliveTargets}}" wx:key="id" wx:if="{{item.id !== view.you}}" class="secondary target-button" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="aim" disabled="{{!canAct}}">瞄准 {{item.name}}</button></view><view wx:else class="muted">等待 {{turnName}} 选择。</view></view>
        <view wx:if="{{view.phase === 'choice'}}" class="card choice-panel"><view class="subtitle">{{view.choice.label}}</view><view class="small muted">当前装备正在结算，其他装备暂时不能打出。</view><block wx:if="{{choiceMine}}"><view wx:if="{{view.choice.kind === 'discard'}}"><view wx:if="{{!privateOpen}}" class="privacy-cover" bindtap="togglePrivate">点击查看私密档案，再选择保留的装备。</view><view wx:for="{{privateOpen ? hand : []}}" wx:key="index" class="equipment-card"><view class="equipment-title">{{item.name}}</view><view>{{item.text}}</view><button class="primary spaced" data-index="{{item.index}}" bindtap="keep" disabled="{{!canAct}}">保留这一张</button></view></view><view wx:elif="{{view.choice.kind === 'inspect'}}"><text class="label">{{choiceTargetName}} 的隐藏身份</text><view class="chips"><button wx:for="{{choiceSlots}}" wx:key="slot" class="secondary" data-slot="{{item.slot}}" bindtap="chooseSlot" disabled="{{!canAct}}">{{item.label}}</button></view></view><view wx:else class="chips"><button wx:for="{{choiceTargets}}" wx:key="id" class="secondary target-button" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="choosePlayer" disabled="{{!canAct}}">{{item.name}}</button></view></block><view wx:else class="muted spaced">等待 {{choiceName}} 选择。</view></view>
        <view wx:if="{{hand.length === 1 && !my.dead && (view.phase === 'turn' || view.phase === 'response' || view.phase === 'aim')}}" class="card"><button class="secondary" bindtap="toggleEquipment" disabled="{{!canAct}}">{{equipmentOpen ? '收起装备' : '使用我的装备'}}</button><block wx:if="{{equipmentOpen}}"><view class="equipment-card"><view class="equipment-title">{{equipment.name}}</view><view>{{equipment.text}}</view></view><block wx:if="{{equipment.form !== 'none'}}"><text class="label">{{equipment.form === 'twoPlayers' ? '从谁手中转移装备' : '选择目标'}}</text><view class="chips"><view wx:for="{{targetsA}}" wx:key="id" class="choice-chip {{targetA === item.id ? 'chosen' : ''}}" data-field="targetA" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="equipTarget">{{item.name}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{!targetsA.length}}" class="small muted">当前没有合法目标。</view></block><view wx:if="{{equipment.form === 'card' || equipment.form === 'twoCards'}}" class="chips"><view wx:for="{{slotsA}}" wx:key="slot" class="choice-chip {{slotA === item.slot ? 'chosen' : ''}}" data-field="slotA" data-slot="{{item.slot}}" bindtap="equipSlot">{{item.label}}</view></view><block wx:if="{{equipment.form === 'twoCards' || equipment.form === 'twoPlayers'}}"><text class="label">{{equipment.form === 'twoPlayers' ? '交给谁' : '另一名玩家'}}</text><view class="chips"><view wx:for="{{targetsB}}" wx:key="id" class="choice-chip {{targetB === item.id ? 'chosen' : ''}}" data-field="targetB" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="equipTarget">{{item.name}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{equipment.form === 'twoCards'}}" class="chips"><view wx:for="{{slotsB}}" wx:key="slot" class="choice-chip {{slotB === item.slot ? 'chosen' : ''}}" data-field="slotB" data-slot="{{item.slot}}" bindtap="equipSlot">{{item.label}}</view></view></block><button class="primary spaced" bindtap="useEquipment" disabled="{{!equipmentValid}}">使用装备</button></block></view>
        <view wx:if="{{view.phase === 'over'}}" class="card result-panel"><view class="result-mark">✦</view><view class="title">{{view.winner === 'honest' ? '正义阵营获胜' : view.winner === 'crooked' ? '腐败阵营获胜' : '双面领袖独自获胜'}}</view><view>{{view.reason}}</view><view class="muted spaced">所有身份已公开，可回看桌上各人的最终阵营。</view><button wx:if="{{host}}" class="primary spaced" bindtap="again" disabled="{{!canAct}}">再来一局</button></view>
        <view wx:if="{{view.history.length}}" class="public-log"><view class="small muted">最近的公开行动</view><view wx:for="{{view.history}}" wx:key="index">{{item}}</view></view>
      </block>
      <view wx:if="{{busy}}" class="small muted">正在确认操作…</view><view class="row footer-actions"><text class="link" bindtap="toggleRules">{{rulesOpen ? '收起规则' : '玩法规则'}}</text><text class="leave-link" bindtap="leave">{{host ? '解散房间' : '退出房间'}}</text></view>
    </block>
    <view wx:if="{{screen === 'entry'}}" class="link rules-link" bindtap="toggleRules">{{rulesOpen ? '收起规则 ↑' : '先看看怎么玩 →'}}</view>
    <view wx:if="{{rulesOpen}}" class="card rules"><view class="subtitle">无间风云 · 第四版基础规则</view><view>4～8 位真人，每人三张身份牌、一张装备。探长和主谋分别发给不同玩家；普通警察按三张牌中正义/腐败的多数决定阵营。持有探长必属正义，持有主谋必属腐败。同时持有两名领袖立即独自获胜。</view><view>回合选择一种行动：调查一张隐藏身份（可以调查自己）；拿一把枪并立即瞄准别人；抽一张装备；向当前枪口目标射击。拿枪或拿装备时，若还有隐藏身份，必须公开一张自己的身份。装备手牌上限一张，超限必须先选留一张，不能靠打出装备避开弃牌。</view><view>每人最多一把枪，本桌共八把。拿到枪立刻瞄准；之后仅在回合末调整枪口，或由装备改变。射击后放下枪。普通警察中弹即出局；领袖首次中弹受伤并抽装备，再次中弹则对方阵营获胜。伤势跟随领袖牌移动，医疗包可治伤。</view><view>任何存活玩家可在行动前、射击前或回合结束前使用装备；部分装备限定时机。装备必须完整结算，选择期间不能打其他装备。用过的瞬时装备进弃牌堆，牌堆用完后洗弃牌堆；持续装备留在桌上。</view><view>手机操作：宣布行动后，所有存活玩家点“确认继续”才结算；有人打装备则重新确认。已确认后仍能在其他人确认前出装备。回合末也保留响应窗口。没有自动超时，离线玩家用原设备重连继续。</view><view>监控反查由持有者选择对方隐藏身份；同一次装备或调查结算中，相同调查关系只触发一次反查，避免摄像头之间无限循环。交换身份会清除相关调查笔记，需重新调查。</view><view>可自由讨论、推理或谎报信息。私密档案只供本人查看；切到后台自动遮住。此版包含19张基础装备，不含僵尸、晋升、卧底等扩展。</view></view>
  </block>
</view>
